<section class="page-banner"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">HERE WHEN YOU NEED US</p><h1>A little <em>help.</em></h1><p>Answers for the most common questions in the CRS demo.</p></div></section><section class="container content-section help-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">QUICK ANSWERS</p><h2>Good to <em>know.</em></h2><div class="faq-list"><details open><summary>Are the train times live?</summary><p>No. The schedules, fares and seat availability are sample data for this coursework project.</p></details><details><summary>Is payment processed?</summary><p>No real payment gateway is connected. Booking confirmation demonstrates the reservation flow only.</p></details><details><summary>How can I download my ticket?</summary><p>After a sample booking, download the plain-text e-ticket from the confirmation page or look it up in My tickets.</p></details><details><summary>How do cancellations, refunds or changes work?</summary><p>Passengers look up bookings under Manage booking. An administrator processes sample cancellation/refund and ticket changes from the Operations page.</p></details><details><summary>What concession fares are shown?</summary><p>Student and senior discounts are simple demonstration rules applied to the route base fare at checkout.</p></details></div></div><aside class="contact-card" id="contact"><img src="assets/images/support.svg" alt="Illustration of a traveller speaking with a railway support representative"><p class="eyebrow">DEMO SUPPORT</p><h3>Need a human touch?</h3><p>For a coursework presentation, an administrator can help with sample booking requests and route changes.</p><a href="?page=admin" class="button secondary">Staff sign in ↗</a><div class="contact-detail"><small>PROJECT HELPLINE</small><strong>+60 3 2267 1200</strong></div><div class="contact-detail"><small>EMAIL</small><strong>hello@crsrailway.test</strong></div></aside></section>
